{
  "name": "Greek Chicken Bowl",
  "description": "Juicy lemon-herb grilled chicken over rice with cucumber, tomatoes, red onion, and a cool creamy tzatziki. A fresh, satisfying meal prep bowl.",
  "group": "Meal Prep - Chicken",
